#38827
mummy rotten corpse~
an ancient mummified corpse~
An ancient mummified corpse lies crumpled and half rotten.~
   This corpse has not been traditionally wrapped in bandages and balming
items.  Rather, it has been mummified magically, so that the incantation slows,
but does not prevent, decay.  The lack of air in the strange sarcophagus no
doubt aided in the preservation of this odd corpse.  No clue or mark gives an
idea to who this body once was, or what.  Whether or not this man or woman or
thing was a ruler, magician, warrior, or necromancer also is uncertain.  
However, that the Warehouse should be holding this mummy poses an odd question.
Why?    
~
