escape chute~
   This escape chute was put here to give a back exit from the Thieve's Guild.
It is a common motto among thieves that you can never have enough exits
because one never knows when some politician might quit taking bribes
and try to make a name for himself by harassing the hard-working thieves
in the city. Many guild members also like to use the chute just to save
time or just for the fun of it. 

A sign near the chute says, "Enter. And hold on tight"
